<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Bluffton School District, Ohio.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Bluffton School District, Ohio.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ohio Company said it priced the $3.200 million of Bluffton Exempted Village School District, Ohio, general obligation unlimited tax school improvement bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.68 percent in 2021.</p>
</text>
